    description: "This is apparently an extremely common dish. Although the Maldives imports much\u00a0of its food, this can be made with pretty much entirely local ingredients: dried fish, coconut, onion, chilies, and lime. It's also super simple to throw together. It's a unique textural mix of semi-jerky-like flaked fish, crunchy onions, and slightly chewy coconut.\u00a0It was fun to eat, and pretty tasty.",
